    "body": "I could only show the wrong version with `heuristic = false`\r\nWith `heuristic = false`, the starship will use the command `dotnet --version` instead of reading global.json\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWithout  `heuristic = false`, I could not reproduce this bug.\r\nI have read the code and I think that the .NET module might be related to the directory structure.\r\nCould you please help to share the directory structure of your .NET project where you see the wrong version?\r\n",
